{"id":"9466be9df2f5cd8c","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-ringed-module-sheaf.md","title":"Ringed Space and Module Sheaf","display":"df-ringed-module-sheaf — Ringed Space and Module Sheaf","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ringed-module-sheaf","aliases":["58-df-ringed-module-sheaf"],"display":"df-ringed-module-sheaf — Ringed Space and Module Sheaf","depends_on":["[[58-df-sheaf]]","[[58-df-module]]","[[58-df-ring-homomorphism]]","[[58-df-surjective]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-zfc-cat-grothendieck-universe]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ringed-module-sheaf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ringed-module-sheaf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ringed-module-sheaf — Ringed Space and Module Sheaf"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b2cb2118f43b23b3\" href=\"?note=b2cb2118f43b23b3\" title=\"58-df-sheaf\">58-df-sheaf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"58-df-module\">58-df-module</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"28f002080d71355a\" href=\"?note=28f002080d71355a\" title=\"58-df-ring-homomorphism\">58-df-ring-homomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f8cb046321ba311\" href=\"?note=9f8cb046321ba311\" title=\"58-df-surjective\">58-df-surjective</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"76fcf4f967d128d9\" href=\"?note=76fcf4f967d128d9\" title=\"58-df-zfc-cat-grothendieck-universe\">58-df-zfc-cat-grothendieck-universe</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> is a Grothendieck universe, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau)\">\\((X,\\tau)\\)</span> is a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>-small topological space, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G\">\\(\\mathcal O,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G\\)</span> are <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>-small presheaf data.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Ring}_U\">\\(\\mathbf{Ring}_U\\)</span> is the category of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>-small unital rings and ring homomorphisms; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Ab}_U\">\\(\\mathbf{Ab}_U\\)</span> is the category of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>-small abelian groups.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho^{\\mathcal H}_{V,W}\\in\\mathcal H(W)^{\\mathcal H(V)}\">\\(\\rho^{\\mathcal H}_{V,W}\\in\\mathcal H(W)^{\\mathcal H(V)}\\)</span> denotes restriction for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V,W\\in\\tau\">\\(V,W\\in\\tau\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\subseteq V\">\\(W\\subseteq V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak R(V)=\\langle +^{\\mathfrak R}_V,\\cdot^{\\mathfrak R}_V,0^{\\mathfrak R}_V,1^{\\mathfrak R}_V\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak R(V)=\\langle +^{\\mathfrak R}_V,\\cdot^{\\mathfrak R}_V,0^{\\mathfrak R}_V,1^{\\mathfrak R}_V\\rangle\\)</span> is a ring-structure family, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal H}(V)=\\langle+^{\\mathcal H}_V,0^{\\mathcal H}_V,\\odot^{\\mathcal H}_V\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal H}(V)=\\langle+^{\\mathcal H}_V,0^{\\mathcal H}_V,\\odot^{\\mathcal H}_V\\rangle\\)</span> is a module-structure family.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Module}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Module}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ring}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Ring}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RingHom}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RingHom}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Surjective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Surjective}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCatGrothendieckUniverse}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCatGrothendieckUniverse}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> are supplied by the dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RingedSpaceData}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RingedSpaceData}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModuleSheafData}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ModuleSheafData}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModuleSheafMorphismData}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ModuleSheafMorphismData}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RingedSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RingedSpace}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SheafOfModules}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SheafOfModules}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModuleSheafMorphism}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ModuleSheafMorphism}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteTypeModuleSheaf}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteTypeModuleSheaf}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KernelModuleSheaf}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{KernelModuleSheaf}_S\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ringed\\text{-}space\\text{-}data}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RingedSpaceData}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal O,U,\\mathfrak R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcCatGrothendieckUniverse}_S(U)\\land X,\\tau,\\mathcal O,\\mathfrak R\\in U\\land\n\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S(\\mathcal O,X,\\tau,\\mathbf{Ring}_U)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathfrak R,\\tau,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathfrak R))\n\\land\\forall V\\in\\tau\\;\\left[\n\\mathfrak R(V)=\\langle +^{\\mathfrak R}_V,\\cdot^{\\mathfrak R}_V,0^{\\mathfrak R}_V,1^{\\mathfrak R}_V\\rangle\n\\land\\operatorname{Ring}_S(\\mathcal O(V),+^{\\mathfrak R}_V,\\cdot^{\\mathfrak R}_V,0^{\\mathfrak R}_V,1^{\\mathfrak R}_V)\\right]\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall V\\in\\tau\\;\\forall W\\in\\tau\\;\\left(W\\subseteq V\\to\n\\mathrm{RingHom}_S(\\rho^{\\mathcal O}_{V,W},\n\\mathcal O(V),+^{\\mathfrak R}_V,\\cdot^{\\mathfrak R}_V,0^{\\mathfrak R}_V,1^{\\mathfrak R}_V,\n\\mathcal O(W),+^{\\mathfrak R}_W,\\cdot^{\\mathfrak R}_W,0^{\\mathfrak R}_W,1^{\\mathfrak R}_W)\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ringed\\text{-}space\\text{-}data}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RingedSpaceData}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal O,U,\\mathfrak R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcCatGrothendieckUniverse}_S(U)\\land X,\\tau,\\mathcal O,\\mathfrak R\\in U\\land\n\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S(\\mathcal O,X,\\tau,\\mathbf{Ring}_U)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathfrak R,\\tau,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathfrak R))\n\\land\\forall V\\in\\tau\\;\\left[\n\\mathfrak R(V)=\\langle +^{\\mathfrak R}_V,\\cdot^{\\mathfrak R}_V,0^{\\mathfrak R}_V,1^{\\mathfrak R}_V\\rangle\n\\land\\operatorname{Ring}_S(\\mathcal O(V),+^{\\mathfrak R}_V,\\cdot^{\\mathfrak R}_V,0^{\\mathfrak R}_V,1^{\\mathfrak R}_V)\\right]\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall V\\in\\tau\\;\\forall W\\in\\tau\\;\\left(W\\subseteq V\\to\n\\mathrm{RingHom}_S(\\rho^{\\mathcal O}_{V,W},\n\\mathcal O(V),+^{\\mathfrak R}_V,\\cdot^{\\mathfrak R}_V,0^{\\mathfrak R}_V,1^{\\mathfrak R}_V,\n\\mathcal O(W),+^{\\mathfrak R}_W,\\cdot^{\\mathfrak R}_W,0^{\\mathfrak R}_W,1^{\\mathfrak R}_W)\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ringed\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RingedSpace}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal O,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathfrak R\\;\\mathrm{RingedSpaceData}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal O,U,\\mathfrak R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ringed\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RingedSpace}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal O,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathfrak R\\;\\mathrm{RingedSpaceData}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal O,U,\\mathfrak R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sheaf\\text{-}of\\text{-}modules\\text{-}data}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ModuleSheafData}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O,X,\\tau,U,\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F})\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{RingedSpaceData}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal O,U,\\mathfrak R)\\land\n\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F}\\in U\\land\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\tau,\\mathbf{Ab}_U)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F},\\tau,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F}))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall V\\in\\tau\\;\\left[\n\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F}(V)=\\langle+^{\\mathcal F}_V,0^{\\mathcal F}_V,\\odot^{\\mathcal F}_V\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{Module}_S(\\mathcal F(V),\\mathcal O(V),+^{\\mathcal F}_V,0^{\\mathcal F}_V,\n+^{\\mathfrak R}_V,\\cdot^{\\mathfrak R}_V,0^{\\mathfrak R}_V,1^{\\mathfrak R}_V,\\odot^{\\mathcal F}_V)\\right]\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall V\\in\\tau\\;\\forall W\\in\\tau\\;\\left(W\\subseteq V\\to\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho^{\\mathcal F}_{V,W},\\mathcal F(V),\\mathcal F(W))\\land\n\\forall s,t\\in\\mathcal F(V)\\;\\rho^{\\mathcal F}_{V,W}(s+^{\\mathcal F}_Vt)\n=\\rho^{\\mathcal F}_{V,W}(s)+^{\\mathcal F}_W\\rho^{\\mathcal F}_{V,W}(t)\\right.\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\left.{}\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathcal O(V)\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathcal F(V)\\;\n\\rho^{\\mathcal F}_{V,W}(a\\odot^{\\mathcal F}_Vs)\n=\\rho^{\\mathcal O}_{V,W}(a)\\odot^{\\mathcal F}_W\\rho^{\\mathcal F}_{V,W}(s)\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sheaf\\text{-}of\\text{-}modules\\text{-}data}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ModuleSheafData}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O,X,\\tau,U,\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F})\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{RingedSpaceData}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal O,U,\\mathfrak R)\\land\n\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F}\\in U\\land\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\tau,\\mathbf{Ab}_U)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F},\\tau,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F}))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall V\\in\\tau\\;\\left[\n\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F}(V)=\\langle+^{\\mathcal F}_V,0^{\\mathcal F}_V,\\odot^{\\mathcal F}_V\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{Module}_S(\\mathcal F(V),\\mathcal O(V),+^{\\mathcal F}_V,0^{\\mathcal F}_V,\n+^{\\mathfrak R}_V,\\cdot^{\\mathfrak R}_V,0^{\\mathfrak R}_V,1^{\\mathfrak R}_V,\\odot^{\\mathcal F}_V)\\right]\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall V\\in\\tau\\;\\forall W\\in\\tau\\;\\left(W\\subseteq V\\to\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho^{\\mathcal F}_{V,W},\\mathcal F(V),\\mathcal F(W))\\land\n\\forall s,t\\in\\mathcal F(V)\\;\\rho^{\\mathcal F}_{V,W}(s+^{\\mathcal F}_Vt)\n=\\rho^{\\mathcal F}_{V,W}(s)+^{\\mathcal F}_W\\rho^{\\mathcal F}_{V,W}(t)\\right.\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\left.{}\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathcal O(V)\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathcal F(V)\\;\n\\rho^{\\mathcal F}_{V,W}(a\\odot^{\\mathcal F}_Vs)\n=\\rho^{\\mathcal O}_{V,W}(a)\\odot^{\\mathcal F}_W\\rho^{\\mathcal F}_{V,W}(s)\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sheaf\\text{-}of\\text{-}modules}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SheafOfModules}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O,X,\\tau,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F}\\;\n\\mathrm{ModuleSheafData}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O,X,\\tau,U,\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sheaf\\text{-}of\\text{-}modules}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SheafOfModules}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O,X,\\tau,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F}\\;\n\\mathrm{ModuleSheafData}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O,X,\\tau,U,\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}module\\text{-}sheaf\\text{-}morphism\\text{-}data}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ModuleSheafMorphismData}_S(\\phi,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G,\\mathcal O,U_0,X,\\tau,U,\n\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F},\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal G})\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;U_0\\in\\tau\\land\n\\mathrm{ModuleSheafData}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O,X,\\tau,U,\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F})\\land\n\\mathrm{ModuleSheafData}_S(\\mathcal G,\\mathcal O,X,\\tau,U,\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal G})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\\phi,\\{V\\in\\tau:V\\subseteq U_0\\},\\bigcup_{\\substack{V\\in\\tau\\\\V\\subseteq U_0}}\\mathcal G(V)^{\\mathcal F(V)}\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall V\\in\\tau\\;\\left(V\\subseteq U_0\\to\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\phi(V),\\mathcal F(V),\\mathcal G(V))\\land\n\\forall s,t\\in\\mathcal F(V)\\;\\phi(V)(s+^{\\mathcal F}_Vt)=\\phi(V)(s)+^{\\mathcal G}_V\\phi(V)(t)\\right.\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\left.{}\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathcal O(V)\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathcal F(V)\\;\n\\phi(V)(a\\odot^{\\mathcal F}_Vs)=a\\odot^{\\mathcal G}_V\\phi(V)(s)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall V\\in\\tau\\;\\forall W\\in\\tau\\;\\left(\nW\\subseteq V\\land V\\subseteq U_0\\to\n\\rho^{\\mathcal G}_{V,W}\\circ\\phi(V)=\\phi(W)\\circ\\rho^{\\mathcal F}_{V,W}\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}module\\text{-}sheaf\\text{-}morphism\\text{-}data}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ModuleSheafMorphismData}_S(\\phi,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G,\\mathcal O,U_0,X,\\tau,U,\n\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F},\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal G})\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;U_0\\in\\tau\\land\n\\mathrm{ModuleSheafData}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O,X,\\tau,U,\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F})\\land\n\\mathrm{ModuleSheafData}_S(\\mathcal G,\\mathcal O,X,\\tau,U,\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal G})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\\phi,\\{V\\in\\tau:V\\subseteq U_0\\},\\bigcup_{\\substack{V\\in\\tau\\\\V\\subseteq U_0}}\\mathcal G(V)^{\\mathcal F(V)}\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall V\\in\\tau\\;\\left(V\\subseteq U_0\\to\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\phi(V),\\mathcal F(V),\\mathcal G(V))\\land\n\\forall s,t\\in\\mathcal F(V)\\;\\phi(V)(s+^{\\mathcal F}_Vt)=\\phi(V)(s)+^{\\mathcal G}_V\\phi(V)(t)\\right.\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\left.{}\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathcal O(V)\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathcal F(V)\\;\n\\phi(V)(a\\odot^{\\mathcal F}_Vs)=a\\odot^{\\mathcal G}_V\\phi(V)(s)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall V\\in\\tau\\;\\forall W\\in\\tau\\;\\left(\nW\\subseteq V\\land V\\subseteq U_0\\to\n\\rho^{\\mathcal G}_{V,W}\\circ\\phi(V)=\\phi(W)\\circ\\rho^{\\mathcal F}_{V,W}\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}module\\text{-}sheaf\\text{-}morphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ModuleSheafMorphism}_S(\\phi,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G,\\mathcal O,U_0,X,\\tau,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F},\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal G}\\;\n\\mathrm{ModuleSheafMorphismData}_S(\\phi,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G,\\mathcal O,U_0,X,\\tau,U,\n\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F},\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal G})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}module\\text{-}sheaf\\text{-}morphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ModuleSheafMorphism}_S(\\phi,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G,\\mathcal O,U_0,X,\\tau,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F},\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal G}\\;\n\\mathrm{ModuleSheafMorphismData}_S(\\phi,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G,\\mathcal O,U_0,X,\\tau,U,\n\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F},\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal G})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}type\\text{-}module\\text{-}sheaf}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FiniteTypeModuleSheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O,X,\\tau,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SheafOfModules}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O,X,\\tau,U)\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists U_0\\in\\tau\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\phi\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;x\\in U_0\\land\\mathrm{ModuleSheafMorphism}_S(\\phi,\\mathcal O^n,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O,U_0,X,\\tau,U)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall V\\in\\tau\\;(V\\subseteq U_0\\to\\mathrm{Surjective}(\\phi(V),\\mathcal O(V)^n,\\mathcal F(V)))\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}type\\text{-}module\\text{-}sheaf}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FiniteTypeModuleSheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O,X,\\tau,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SheafOfModules}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O,X,\\tau,U)\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists U_0\\in\\tau\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\phi\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;x\\in U_0\\land\\mathrm{ModuleSheafMorphism}_S(\\phi,\\mathcal O^n,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O,U_0,X,\\tau,U)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall V\\in\\tau\\;(V\\subseteq U_0\\to\\mathrm{Surjective}(\\phi(V),\\mathcal O(V)^n,\\mathcal F(V)))\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}module\\text{-}sheaf}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KernelModuleSheaf}_S(\\mathcal K,\\phi,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G,\\mathcal O,U_0,X,\\tau,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F},\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal G},\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal K}\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ModuleSheafMorphismData}_S(\\phi,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G,\\mathcal O,U_0,X,\\tau,U,\n\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F},\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal G})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{ModuleSheafData}_S(\\mathcal K,\\mathcal O,X,\\tau,U,\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal K})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall V\\in\\tau\\;(V\\subseteq U_0\\to\n\\mathcal K(V)=\\{s\\in\\mathcal F(V):\\phi(V)(s)=0^{\\mathcal G}_V\\})\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}module\\text{-}sheaf}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KernelModuleSheaf}_S(\\mathcal K,\\phi,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G,\\mathcal O,U_0,X,\\tau,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F},\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal G},\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal K}\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ModuleSheafMorphismData}_S(\\phi,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G,\\mathcal O,U_0,X,\\tau,U,\n\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F},\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal G})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{ModuleSheafData}_S(\\mathcal K,\\mathcal O,X,\\tau,U,\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal K})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall V\\in\\tau\\;(V\\subseteq U_0\\to\n\\mathcal K(V)=\\{s\\in\\mathcal F(V):\\phi(V)(s)=0^{\\mathcal G}_V\\})\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ring, module, and morphism structures are carried by global families over all opens. Thus the restriction and linearity clauses refer to the same operations on overlaps instead of re-choosing unrelated structures for each inclusion.</li>\n<li>The codomain used to type a local morphism ranges only over open subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_0\">\\(U_0\\)</span>; values at arbitrary non-open subsets are not invoked.</li>\n<li>Finite type is local surjectivity from a finite free module sheaf; the kernel sheaf is defined sectionwise and inherits its restriction maps.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"b2cb2118f43b23b3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sheaf]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-module","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-module]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ring-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"28f002080d71355a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ring-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-surjective","status":"resolved","id":"9f8cb046321ba311","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-surjective]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-cat-grothendieck-universe","status":"resolved","id":"76fcf4f967d128d9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-cat-grothendieck-universe]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Ring}_U","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Ab}_U","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho^{\\mathcal H}_{V,W}\\in\\mathcal H(W)^{\\mathcal H(V)}","display":false},{"tex":"V,W\\in\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"W\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak R(V)=\\langle +^{\\mathfrak R}_V,\\cdot^{\\mathfrak R}_V,0^{\\mathfrak R}_V,1^{\\mathfrak R}_V\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal H}(V)=\\langle+^{\\mathcal H}_V,0^{\\mathcal H}_V,\\odot^{\\mathcal H}_V\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Module}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ring}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RingHom}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Surjective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCatGrothendieckUniverse}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RingedSpaceData}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ModuleSheafData}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ModuleSheafMorphismData}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RingedSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SheafOfModules}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ModuleSheafMorphism}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FiniteTypeModuleSheaf}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KernelModuleSheaf}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ringed\\text{-}space\\text{-}data}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RingedSpaceData}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal O,U,\\mathfrak R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{ZfcCatGrothendieckUniverse}_S(U)\\land X,\\tau,\\mathcal O,\\mathfrak R\\in U\\land\n\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S(\\mathcal O,X,\\tau,\\mathbf{Ring}_U)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathfrak R,\\tau,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathfrak R))\n\\land\\forall V\\in\\tau\\;\\left[\n\\mathfrak R(V)=\\langle +^{\\mathfrak R}_V,\\cdot^{\\mathfrak R}_V,0^{\\mathfrak R}_V,1^{\\mathfrak R}_V\\rangle\n\\land\\operatorname{Ring}_S(\\mathcal O(V),+^{\\mathfrak R}_V,\\cdot^{\\mathfrak R}_V,0^{\\mathfrak R}_V,1^{\\mathfrak R}_V)\\right]\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall V\\in\\tau\\;\\forall W\\in\\tau\\;\\left(W\\subseteq V\\to\n\\mathrm{RingHom}_S(\\rho^{\\mathcal O}_{V,W},\n\\mathcal O(V),+^{\\mathfrak R}_V,\\cdot^{\\mathfrak R}_V,0^{\\mathfrak R}_V,1^{\\mathfrak R}_V,\n\\mathcal O(W),+^{\\mathfrak R}_W,\\cdot^{\\mathfrak R}_W,0^{\\mathfrak R}_W,1^{\\mathfrak R}_W)\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ringed\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RingedSpace}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal O,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathfrak R\\;\\mathrm{RingedSpaceData}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal O,U,\\mathfrak R)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sheaf\\text{-}of\\text{-}modules\\text{-}data}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ModuleSheafData}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O,X,\\tau,U,\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F})\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{RingedSpaceData}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal O,U,\\mathfrak R)\\land\n\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F}\\in U\\land\\operatorname{Sheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,X,\\tau,\\mathbf{Ab}_U)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F},\\tau,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F}))\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall V\\in\\tau\\;\\left[\n\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F}(V)=\\langle+^{\\mathcal F}_V,0^{\\mathcal F}_V,\\odot^{\\mathcal F}_V\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{Module}_S(\\mathcal F(V),\\mathcal O(V),+^{\\mathcal F}_V,0^{\\mathcal F}_V,\n+^{\\mathfrak R}_V,\\cdot^{\\mathfrak R}_V,0^{\\mathfrak R}_V,1^{\\mathfrak R}_V,\\odot^{\\mathcal F}_V)\\right]\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall V\\in\\tau\\;\\forall W\\in\\tau\\;\\left(W\\subseteq V\\to\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho^{\\mathcal F}_{V,W},\\mathcal F(V),\\mathcal F(W))\\land\n\\forall s,t\\in\\mathcal F(V)\\;\\rho^{\\mathcal F}_{V,W}(s+^{\\mathcal F}_Vt)\n=\\rho^{\\mathcal F}_{V,W}(s)+^{\\mathcal F}_W\\rho^{\\mathcal F}_{V,W}(t)\\right.\\\\\n&\\qquad\\left.{}\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathcal O(V)\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathcal F(V)\\;\n\\rho^{\\mathcal F}_{V,W}(a\\odot^{\\mathcal F}_Vs)\n=\\rho^{\\mathcal O}_{V,W}(a)\\odot^{\\mathcal F}_W\\rho^{\\mathcal F}_{V,W}(s)\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sheaf\\text{-}of\\text{-}modules}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SheafOfModules}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O,X,\\tau,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F}\\;\n\\mathrm{ModuleSheafData}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O,X,\\tau,U,\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F})","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}module\\text{-}sheaf\\text{-}morphism\\text{-}data}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ModuleSheafMorphismData}_S(\\phi,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G,\\mathcal O,U_0,X,\\tau,U,\n\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F},\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal G})\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&U_0\\in\\tau\\land\n\\mathrm{ModuleSheafData}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O,X,\\tau,U,\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F})\\land\n\\mathrm{ModuleSheafData}_S(\\mathcal G,\\mathcal O,X,\\tau,U,\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal G})\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\\phi,\\{V\\in\\tau:V\\subseteq U_0\\},\\bigcup_{\\substack{V\\in\\tau\\\\V\\subseteq U_0}}\\mathcal G(V)^{\\mathcal F(V)}\\right)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall V\\in\\tau\\;\\left(V\\subseteq U_0\\to\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\phi(V),\\mathcal F(V),\\mathcal G(V))\\land\n\\forall s,t\\in\\mathcal F(V)\\;\\phi(V)(s+^{\\mathcal F}_Vt)=\\phi(V)(s)+^{\\mathcal G}_V\\phi(V)(t)\\right.\\\\\n&\\qquad\\left.{}\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathcal O(V)\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathcal F(V)\\;\n\\phi(V)(a\\odot^{\\mathcal F}_Vs)=a\\odot^{\\mathcal G}_V\\phi(V)(s)\\right)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall V\\in\\tau\\;\\forall W\\in\\tau\\;\\left(\nW\\subseteq V\\land V\\subseteq U_0\\to\n\\rho^{\\mathcal G}_{V,W}\\circ\\phi(V)=\\phi(W)\\circ\\rho^{\\mathcal F}_{V,W}\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}module\\text{-}sheaf\\text{-}morphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ModuleSheafMorphism}_S(\\phi,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G,\\mathcal O,U_0,X,\\tau,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F},\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal G}\\;\n\\mathrm{ModuleSheafMorphismData}_S(\\phi,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G,\\mathcal O,U_0,X,\\tau,U,\n\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F},\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal G})","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}type\\text{-}module\\text{-}sheaf}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FiniteTypeModuleSheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O,X,\\tau,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SheafOfModules}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O,X,\\tau,U)\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists U_0\\in\\tau\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\phi\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&x\\in U_0\\land\\mathrm{ModuleSheafMorphism}_S(\\phi,\\mathcal O^n,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O,U_0,X,\\tau,U)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall V\\in\\tau\\;(V\\subseteq U_0\\to\\mathrm{Surjective}(\\phi(V),\\mathcal O(V)^n,\\mathcal F(V)))\n\\end{aligned}\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}module\\text{-}sheaf}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KernelModuleSheaf}_S(\\mathcal K,\\phi,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G,\\mathcal O,U_0,X,\\tau,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F},\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal G},\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal K}\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{ModuleSheafMorphismData}_S(\\phi,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G,\\mathcal O,U_0,X,\\tau,U,\n\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal F},\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal G})\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{ModuleSheafData}_S(\\mathcal K,\\mathcal O,X,\\tau,U,\\mathfrak R,\\mathfrak M_{\\mathcal K})\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall V\\in\\tau\\;(V\\subseteq U_0\\to\n\\mathcal K(V)=\\{s\\in\\mathcal F(V):\\phi(V)(s)=0^{\\mathcal G}_V\\})\n\\end{aligned}\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"U_0","display":false}],"bytes":7700,"backlinks":[{"id":"13f5e356bc6a9655","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RingedSpace}_S$, $\\mathrm{SheafOfModules}_S$, $\\mathrm{ModuleSheafMorphism}_S$, $\\mathrm{FiniteTypeModuleSheaf}_S$, and $\\mathrm{KernelModuleSheaf}_S$ are supplied by [[58-df-ringed-module-sheaf]]."},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-369","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[58-df-ringed-module-sheaf]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1102","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-ringed-module-sheaf.md|58-df-ringed-module-sheaf]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["b2cb2118f43b23b3","ef3a5dd6825f0373","28f002080d71355a","9f8cb046321ba311","36d7463d215be751","76fcf4f967d128d9"]}